    "markdown": "---\ntitle: \"Análise de Perfis Aerodinâmicos\"\nformat:\n  dashboard:\n    theme:\n      light: \n        - pulse\n        - ../scss/main.scss\n        - ../scss/modules/dashboard.scss\n        - ../scss/themes/light.scss\n      dark:\n        - darkly\n        - ../scss/main.scss\n        - ../scss/modules/dashboard.scss\n        - ../scss/themes/dark.scss\neditor_options:\n  chunk_output_type: console\nserver: shiny\n---\n\n\n\n# Perfis\n\n## Column {.tabset}\n\n\n::: {.cell title='{{< var profile_wing >}}'}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<button id=\"id\" type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-default action-button\"><span class=\"action-label\">Texto</span></button>\n```\n\n:::\n:::\n\n\n\n::: {.cell title='{{< var profile_stabilizer_horizontal >}}'}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<button id=\"id\" type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-default action-button\"><span class=\"action-label\">Texto</span></button>\n```\n\n:::\n:::\n\n\n\n::: {.cell title='{{< var profile_stabilizer_vertical >}}'}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<button id=\"id\" type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-default action-button\"><span class=\"action-label\">Texto</span></button>\n```\n\n:::\n:::\n\n\n## Row\n\n## Column\n\n# Comparar Perfis\n\n\n::: {.cell content='sidebar' title='Configurações'}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"form-group shiny-input-container\">\n<label class=\"control-label\" id=\"input_metric-label\" for=\"input_metric\">Métrica:</label>\n<div>\n<select id=\"input_metric\" class=\"shiny-input-select\"><option value=\"cd_cl\" selected>Cd vs Cl</option>\n<option value=\"cl_alpha\">Cl vs Alfa</option>\n<option value=\"cd_alpha\">Cd vs Alfa</option></select>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"input_metric\" data-nonempty=\"\">{\"plugins\":[\"selectize-plugin-a11y\"]}</script>\n</div>\n</div>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"form-group shiny-input-container\">\n<label class=\"control-label\" id=\"cmb_axis_x-label\" for=\"cmb_axis_x\">Eixo X:</label>\n<div>\n<select id=\"cmb_axis_x\" class=\"shiny-input-select\"><option value=\"alpha\" selected>Alfa (Ângulo de Ataque)</option>\n<option value=\"speed\">Velocidade</option></select>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"cmb_axis_x\" data-nonempty=\"\">{\"plugins\":[\"selectize-plugin-a11y\"]}</script>\n</div>\n</div>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<div id=\"chkgrp_profiles\" class=\"form-group shiny-input-checkboxgroup shiny-input-container\" role=\"group\" aria-labelledby=\"chkgrp_profiles-label\">\n<label class=\"control-label\" id=\"chkgrp_profiles-label\" for=\"chkgrp_profiles\">Visualizar Perfis:</label>\n<div class=\"shiny-options-group\">\n<div class=\"checkbox\">\n<label>\n<input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"chkgrp_profiles\" value=\"profile_wing\"/>\n<span>Asa</span>\n</label>\n</div>\n<div class=\"checkbox\">\n<label>\n<input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"chkgrp_profiles\" value=\"profile_stabilizer_horizontal\"/>\n<span>Empenagem (Horizontal)</span>\n</label>\n</div>\n<div class=\"checkbox\">\n<label>\n<input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"chkgrp_profiles\" value=\"profile_stabilizer_vertical\"/>\n<span>Empenagem (Vertical)</span>\n</label>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n```\n\n:::\n:::\n\n\n## Row {height=50%}\n\n### Chart 1\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"shiny-plot-output html-fill-item\" id=\"out02bd66e427893368\" style=\"width:100%;height:400px;\"></div>\n```\n\n:::\n:::\n\n\n## Row {height=50%}\n\n### Chart 2\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n:::\n\n\n### Chart 3\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n:::\n\npreserve4b21f9a7bee78848\npreservedba3cd0ccae52dc9\n\n<!--html_preserve-->\n<script type=\"application/shiny-prerendered\" data-context=\"dependencies\">\n{\"type\":\"list\",\"attributes\":{},\"value\":[{\"type\":\"list\",\"attributes\":{\"names\":{\"type\":\"character\",\"attributes\":{},\"value\":[\"name\",\"version\",\"src\",\"meta\",\"scrip